# Machine-translated fallback strings for Indonesian (id).
#
# NOT part of the Weblate corpus.  These fill entries that po/id.po does not
# translate, which would otherwise render in English; a human translation always
# wins over anything here.  See apply-machine-translations.py.
#
# Corrections belong upstream on Weblate — https://hosted.weblate.org/engage/wincompose/
